WEBVTT

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:10.240
I can't finish reading the magazine pages

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:17.150
I get the feeling that I must read it

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:23.900
Game cartridges are stacked in the corner of the room

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:30.600
Is there no meaning if I don't play them?

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:35.700
You're on the other side of the table

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:39.070
I'm talking to you, but...

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:46.000
You don't change your facial expression at all

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:52.250
Even though I'm this close to you

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:59.520
These feelings don't reach you, don't reach you

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:06.260
What is truly precious?

00:01:09.950 --> 00:01:15.950
DM Quest 3
Dragon Master Knight

00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:40.780
Hey, we're in the air!

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:44.100
We're on the flying ship!

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:44.730
Yeah!

00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:45.670
We did it!

00:01:45.670 --> 00:01:46.420
Stop it!

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:55.670
Hey!

00:01:58.450 --> 00:02:01.520
Earu, you're coming with us?

00:02:02.090 --> 00:02:04.940
Okay, let's go to the dark floating castle!

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:06.430
All right!

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:10.360
Here we go!

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:15.050
We're counting on you!

00:02:19.810 --> 00:02:22.550
We leave it to you, heroes.

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:32.200
You're surrounded.  Give up.

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:36.050
We won't let you lay a finger on Yugi!

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:50.770
Here they come!

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:51.900
We're plunging in!

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:55.370
This will be a nice challenge.

00:02:55.370 --> 00:02:56.690
Harpie, Rose Whip!

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:01.160
Giltia the D. Knight!

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:05.040
Dark Magician!

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:10.590
Yeah!  Keep it coming!

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:26.650
Earu!

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:32.590
Swords of Revealing Light!

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:44.700
I'm sorry.

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:45.670
You protected me.

00:03:53.060 --> 00:03:53.920
Yugi.

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:09.390
I'll make you pay, The Big Five!

00:04:12.050 --> 00:04:13.630
We hit the barrier!

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:18.440
Just a little more to break through!

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:23.610
We did it!

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:30.110
What's that?

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:31.630
Damn!

00:04:35.050 --> 00:04:36.600
Why you!

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:43.360
Fire!

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:02.080
The ship...

00:05:17.840 --> 00:05:19.510
You again.

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.730
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:25.860
The second sacrifice has arrived.

00:05:31.210 --> 00:05:32.350
Big brother!

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:34.510
Mokuba!  Why are you here?

00:05:34.510 --> 00:05:36.910
I wanted to save you!

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:40.520
Oh my.  This is a favorable turn of events.

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:43.030
It's time to perform the ritual.

00:05:43.380 --> 00:05:44.890
Shall we begin?

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:49.630
I offer these sacrifices to the great Five-Headed Dragon!

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:52.870
Swordstalker!

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:56.870
Brother, take this!

00:05:56.880 --> 00:05:58.100
Good work, Mokuba.

00:05:58.700 --> 00:05:59.600
What?

00:06:01.010 --> 00:06:03.240
It's time to pay you back.

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:06.940
Come out, Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:11.920
Annihilate him!

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:15.200
Burst Stream of Destruction!

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:18.590
Mokuba, let's go!

00:06:25.390 --> 00:06:27.020
The same trick won't work twice!

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:28.900
Come out, Trap Master!

00:06:35.210 --> 00:06:38.510
I get back my Blue-Eyes that was captured previously.

00:06:38.650 --> 00:06:40.240
Vanish, you weaklings!

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:43.070
Double Burst Stream of Rage!

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:50.570
Mokuba, how did you get here?

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:53.820
Yugi and his friends helped me.

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:57.320
Yugi?  Yugi is in this world?

00:06:57.560 --> 00:06:59.830
I was worried about you.

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:02.250
You didn't need to do that.

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:03.070
Let's go!

00:07:03.070 --> 00:07:04.930
Wait, big brother!

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:13.090
This dark castle sure is peaceful.

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:14.450
No, I sense something.

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:15.870
Look!

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:22.220
Cocoons of Evolution!

00:07:22.220 --> 00:07:23.820
Don't let them open!

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:29.890
Bring it on!

00:07:29.890 --> 00:07:31.230
Giltia the D. Knight!

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:40.420
Giltia!

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:41.570
Man-Eater Bug!

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:43.370
That complicates things.

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:44.610
They're coming!

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:49.580
Mirror Force!

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:07.930
We're too late.

00:08:08.270 --> 00:08:10.570
There's still a way!

00:08:13.980 --> 00:08:15.210
Kuriboh?

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:22.410
I'll use this to destroy Great Moth!

00:08:22.670 --> 00:08:24.280
Launch Kuriboh!

00:08:38.840 --> 00:08:40.530
We did it!

00:08:40.690 --> 00:08:42.500
Banzai!

00:08:42.690 --> 00:08:44.280
Unbelievable.

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:46.980
Yugi Muto made it this far.

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:48.510
It's come to this.

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:57.110
What's that?

00:09:08.370 --> 00:09:09.520
Blue-Eyes?

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:14.410
Kaiba!  Mokuba!

00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:15.980
You're safe!

00:09:15.980 --> 00:09:17.130
We were worried.

00:09:17.810 --> 00:09:20.650
I don't need a loser to worry about me.

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:23.890
Say what!  Who do you think helped you?

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:27.730
It's impressive that you made it this far.

00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:32.950
Your attempt to sacrifice me has failed.

00:09:33.280 --> 00:09:34.800
Seto Kaiba?

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:35.970
How are you here?

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:40.520
The legendary Five-Headed Dragon can no longer resurrect!

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:42.470
I've cleared the game!

00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:46.080
We won't allow that.

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:47.200
Exactly.

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:49.820
What?

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:51.820
What's happening?

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:07.380
That's the legendary Five-Headed Dragon.

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:22.720
You're cheating!

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:25.400
You can't resurrect Five-Headed Dragon!

00:10:27.370 --> 00:10:31.410
A quality game has unexpected plot twists.

00:10:32.280 --> 00:10:36.170
I see.  You're desperate.

00:10:36.370 --> 00:10:39.250
Fine.  We accept this duel!

00:10:39.440 --> 00:10:40.480
Battle!

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:45.190
Here I go!  Harpie Lady Sisters!

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:49.990
What?

00:10:51.490 --> 00:10:53.950
Look at the ground beneath your feet.

00:10:57.270 --> 00:10:58.840
Lord of D.?

00:10:59.020 --> 00:11:01.800
Correct.  This is sacred ground for dragons.

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:06.140
Non-Dragon-Type monsters can't battle here.

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:13.020
You're challenging me to a Dragon-Type battle?

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:15.250
I admire your enthusiasm.

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:18.420
Come out, Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:22.260
I'll do it too!

00:11:22.260 --> 00:11:24.130
Come out, Red-Eyes!

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:28.810
Harpie's Pet Dragon!

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:33.320
Curse of Dragon!

00:11:40.180 --> 00:11:41.250
Here we go!

00:11:58.880 --> 00:12:00.980
It stopped our attacks!

00:12:00.980 --> 00:12:05.100
I see.  The five heads can act independently.

00:12:06.890 --> 00:12:10.380
But one head can still attack.

00:12:10.380 --> 00:12:12.600
Let's teach you a lesson.

00:12:13.860 --> 00:12:15.450
What?  You don't mean...

00:12:16.780 --> 00:12:18.450
Be gone, Mokuba!

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:19.290
Mokuba!

00:12:20.730 --> 00:12:22.280
Mokuba!

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:35.380
Jonouchi!

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:36.260
Jonouchi!

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:40.480
Yugi, I leave the rest to you.

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:41.500
Jonouchi!

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:44.000
Jonouchi...

00:12:47.670 --> 00:12:48.850
Jonouchi...

00:12:48.960 --> 00:12:50.230
Jonouchi!

00:12:50.230 --> 00:12:51.620
Jonouchi!

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:54.360
That was unfair!

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:57.020
Directly attacking a player is against the rules!

00:12:57.200 --> 00:12:58.230
Unfair?

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:02.520
We make the rules in this world.

00:13:02.740 --> 00:13:04.190
You scum!

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:09.340
When the mightiest dragon and soldier stand together, the evil god will be destroyed.

00:13:09.340 --> 00:13:10.270
What do you mean?

00:13:10.480 --> 00:13:12.630
It's a legend told in this world.

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:15.050
It's a hint on how to defeat them!

00:13:16.880 --> 00:13:20.540
Gaia The Fierce Knight, transform into the legendary knight!

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:40.930
You were so shaken that you forgot about the seal.

00:13:40.930 --> 00:13:45.930
As long as you're on the dragon's sacred ground, Black Luster Soldier cannot battle.

00:13:45.930 --> 00:13:47.300
Exactly.

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:49.640
We'll pulverize your Black Luster Soldier.

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:51.330
I won't let you!

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:52.880
I'll take you on!

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:56.600
You're in our way!  Vanish!

00:13:59.310 --> 00:13:59.910
Mai!

00:14:05.840 --> 00:14:06.620
Mai!

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:13.990
Yugi, I don't know what you're planning, but I believe in you.

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:16.740
You must win!

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:26.040
Mai, you risked your life to assist me.

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:27.570
I won't let that go to waste!

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:31.210
Kaiba, now's your chance to summon your Ultimate Dragon!

00:14:31.420 --> 00:14:34.080
Are you ordering me around?

00:14:34.650 --> 00:14:36.580
This is no time to argue!

00:14:36.580 --> 00:14:38.560
I don't need your help!

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:40.590
I can defeat them by myself!

00:14:40.840 --> 00:14:42.320
Keep talking, Kaiba.

00:14:42.320 --> 00:14:45.120
We'll destroy you and your Blue-Eyes.

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:49.370
Kaiba, summon Ultimate Dragon!

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:50.230
Silence!

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:52.460
Big brother!

00:14:56.100 --> 00:14:57.140
Mokuba!

00:14:57.450 --> 00:14:58.840
Big brother...

00:15:06.900 --> 00:15:09.340
Mokuba!

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:13.450
Now you know how powerless you are, Kaiba.

00:15:13.710 --> 00:15:19.460
Seto, we'll soon reunite you with your dear brother.

00:15:20.090 --> 00:15:22.070
Stand up, Kaiba!

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:24.570
Don't let Mokuba's wishes go to waste!

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:28.840
I'll make you pay, The Big Five!

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:31.840
Come out, Ultimate Dragon!

00:15:31.930 --> 00:15:35.420
Show your ultimate form!

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:49.460
Even Ultimate Dragon is no match for Five-Headed Dragon's attack points.

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:51.130
Are you sure about that?

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:56.570
When the mightiest dragon and soldier stand together, the evil god will be destroyed.

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:57.750
What?

00:15:57.750 --> 00:16:05.070
There's a monster that you can summon when Black Luster Soldier and Ultimate Dragon are together?

00:16:05.070 --> 00:16:06.840
You're about to find out!

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:08.820
Go, Black Luster Soldier!

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:10.810
Go, Ultimate!

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:15.180
We'll stop you!

00:16:18.940 --> 00:16:20.820
What?  We were repelled!

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:31.060
Dragon Master Knight!

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:38.180
What?

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:44.410
Those dragons were sent to the graveyard.

00:16:53.430 --> 00:16:58.660
Dragon Master Knight gains attack points for every dragon on the field.

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:03.270
Are you watching, Jonouchi, Mai and Mokuba?

00:17:03.550 --> 00:17:05.420
This is your power!

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:12.100
Go, Dragon Master Knight!

00:17:12.100 --> 00:17:14.290
Galaxy Crusher!

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:22.000
Impossible!

00:17:38.180 --> 00:17:39.540
Where are we?

00:17:47.300 --> 00:17:49.750
You defeated the evil god.

00:17:50.120 --> 00:17:52.750
You brought peace to our world.

00:17:52.990 --> 00:17:55.340
What about Jonouchi?

00:17:57.420 --> 00:17:59.590
This was a hollow victory.

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:05.600
Heroes, now that the evil god is gone, it's my turn to repay you.

00:18:11.740 --> 00:18:15.100
That's the Princess's true identity.

00:18:26.220 --> 00:18:27.150
Everyone!

00:18:27.150 --> 00:18:27.950
Mokuba!

00:18:28.740 --> 00:18:30.950
Huh?  What happened to us?

00:18:30.950 --> 00:18:31.820
Big brother!

00:18:39.690 --> 00:18:42.200
That must be the exit.

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:43.870
Wait a sec, Kaiba!

00:18:44.240 --> 00:18:47.520
It wouldn't hurt you to say thanks.

00:18:47.650 --> 00:18:51.870
You couldn't have defeated Five-Headed Dragon without me.

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:52.970
Say what?

00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:57.480
Yugi, I want to ask you one thing.

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:04.280
Did you know that Dragon Master Knight existed all along?

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:09.310
As long as we believe in our cards, they'll always provide a way.

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:11.820
I believed in my cards at that time.

00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:14.560
As did you, Kaiba.

00:19:16.240 --> 00:19:17.460
Let's go, Mokuba.

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:18.570
Brother!

00:19:19.640 --> 00:19:21.320
Forget about him, Jonouchi.

00:19:21.320 --> 00:19:22.540
Thank you, heroes.

00:19:23.380 --> 00:19:25.900
I will never forget you.

00:19:26.030 --> 00:19:28.460
Mary and Earu, goodbye.

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:29.230
See ya.

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:30.010
Take care.

00:19:34.140 --> 00:19:35.400
Honda!

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:36.520
You won't get past me!

00:19:37.840 --> 00:19:38.540
What?

00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:41.250
Jonouchi!

00:19:43.840 --> 00:19:44.820
Yugi!

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:46.480
Where's Kaiba?

00:19:46.480 --> 00:19:47.410
He's fine.

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:49.630
He should be back in this world.

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:51.130
Say what?

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:53.440
Too bad, Saruwatari!

00:19:53.440 --> 00:19:55.640
Your plot is over!

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:57.710
Damn!  Retreat!

00:19:58.930 --> 00:19:59.920
We did it!

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:01.040
That's what you get!

00:20:01.640 --> 00:20:03.140
That was a nice nap.

00:20:04.230 --> 00:20:05.140
Mai?

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:08.560
You were here too?

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:10.080
You were nearby.

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:11.150
Everyone...

00:20:11.360 --> 00:20:13.380
Thank you.  I...

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:14.690
Forget it.

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:18.890
Instead of speeches, hurry up and go to your brother, Mokuba.

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:20.080
Okay!

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:21.500
Let's go home.

00:20:21.500 --> 00:20:23.080
I'm starving.

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:24.060
Me too!

00:20:24.060 --> 00:20:26.720
Then let's go eat ramen!

00:20:26.720 --> 00:20:27.900
Agreed!

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:37.700
Big trouble!  Yugi's grandpa's game shop has a rival!

00:20:37.700 --> 00:20:41.500
They're selling a new game called Dungeon Dice Monsters.

00:20:41.500 --> 00:20:46.730
A smug transfer student named Otogi in the class next door has something to do with this shop.

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:50.200
He shouldn't have, but Jonouchi challenged him to a duel.

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:52.790
If you take him too lightly, you'll be in trouble!

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:56.450
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Mysterious Transfer Student  Ryuji Otogi

00:20:56.450 --> 00:20:58.000
Duel, standby!

00:21:02.550 --> 00:21:10.950
The flask glistens

00:21:11.990 --> 00:21:18.800
Wait for me in the science classroom

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:27.780
If we put our cold hands together

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:35.550
And rub them together, they become warm

00:21:37.250 --> 00:21:41.380
Shower of happiness

00:21:41.670 --> 00:21:45.490
I will shower you with it

00:21:45.820 --> 00:21:53.770
I will support you even when you feel lonely

00:21:53.970 --> 00:21:58.010
Shower of happiness

00:21:58.270 --> 00:22:02.130
You are not alone

00:22:02.510 --> 00:22:08.850
You're protected by a giant ring of friendship
